news.title:
Solana Foundation (@SolanaFndn): Prediction markets let you bet on a single outcome. Umang Verma thinks the bigger opportunity is a way to back an entire belief.

@umang_veerma, founder of Cleopetra, joined @afscott on Solana is Global to talk thesis trading, prediction markets, and how anyone with expertise and an audience can become a fund manager.

Full episode 👇

Aptos Labs (@AptosLabs): Lead with the product. Let the chain stay in the background.

Aptos Labs' @sedall_asante on how @DecibelTrade thinks about traders: markets, execution, easy funding, and integrations with the wallets they already use.

@Aptos is the performance and onchain infrastructure underneath.

